Parts of the following files are ported from Strata (https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata) or from
its IBM Power AC922 fork Strata-AC922 (https://github.com/eelgaev/Strata-AC922, branch ac922),
which carry the same license below. Each file names its source in its header; licenses/README.md
lists every third-party source of this repository.

  ggml/src/ggml-cuda/fused-expert.cu, fused-expert.cuh
      Strata-AC922 src/kernels/cuda/fused_expert.cu (W4A16 fused-expert kernel)
  ggml/src/ggml-cuda/lightning-indexer.cu
      Strata-AC922 src/kernels/cuda/qsa_select.cu (scores_volta_kernel)
  ggml/src/ggml-cuda/qsa.cu
      Strata src/kernels/cuda/qsa_select.cu (block_topk_kernel, block_topk_reg_kernel,
      block_topk_wide_kernel), src/kernels/cuda/qsa_decode_attn.cu (attn_chunk_kernel_pre75,
      attn_merge_kernel), src/kernels/cuda/qsa_prompt_attn.cu (prompt_attn_v70_kernel)
  ggml/src/ggml-cuda/moe-grouped.cu, moe-grouped.cuh
      Strata src/kernels/cuda/s2_expert_grouped.cu (kernel structure)
  ggml/src/ggml-cuda/dsv4-hc.cu
      Strata src/kernels/cuda/fused_gr.cu (gate arithmetic of the gated post epilogue)
  ggml/src/ggml-cuda/unary.cu
      Strata src/kernels/cuda/fused_gr.cu (scaled SiLU epilogue)

